{"timestamp":"2026-09-01T06:58:18.585147Z","level":"WARN","message":"Vertex shader with entry point vertex outputs a @builtin(position) without the @invariant attribute and is used in a pipeline with Equal. On some machines, this can cause bad artifacting as Equal assumes the values output from the vertex shader exactly match the value in the depth buffer. The @invariant attribute on the @builtin(position) vertex output ensures that the exact same pixel depths are used every render.","log.target":"wgpu_core::validation","log.module_path":"wgpu_core::validation","log.file":"C:\\Users\\karen\\.cargo\\registry\\src\\index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f\\wgpu-core-29.0.4\\src\\validation.rs","log.line":1478,"target":"wgpu_core::validation","filename":"C:\\Users\\karen\\.cargo\\registry\\src\\index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f\\wgpu-core-29.0.4\\src\\validation.rs","line_number":1478,"threadId":"ThreadId(7)"}
